{"name":"Transfer registration with sequential number and atomic commit","category":"lifecycle","priority":"P0","statement":"Each completed transfer is recorded in TRANSFERENCIAS with the next sequential number (highest existing + 1, starting at 1), the amount, commission and type. Debit, credit and record are committed together, then the user is shown 'TRANSFERENCIA REALIZADA' with the commission and is redirected to the receipt.","condition":"Debit and credit executed","action":"numero = ISNULL(MAX(TRF_NUMERO),0)+1; insert record with origin, destination, amount, commission, type; commit; show commission with 2 decimals and the message 'TRANSFERENCIA REALIZADA'; redirect to Comprobante.aspx?numero=numero."}

